;gives good old MC-chan a 7 day cold
@GET_AIDS(ARG=-1,ARG:1=1,ARG:2=7)
#FUNCTION
SIF ARG == -1
    ARG = MASTER
;CALLF CHARA_GET_DISEASE(ARG,1,7)

;----------
;Common cold
;-----
;Effects:
;- 10% more STA used on physical actions
;- Random chance to sneeze or cough, removing a small part of STA (~20)
;   - roughly you'll get it once every 30 or so actions
;- Can also get others sick by increasing DISEASE_POINTs when you cough in the same location as them (dependent on branch. in ATW only MC-chan can get sick)
;- If it's allowed to develop, it will turn into influenza.
;----------

@SICK_WARNING()
PRINTDATAW
DATAFORM You don't feel so great. It's almost like you're about to get sick
ENDDATA

@WAKE_UP_SICK
PRINTDATAW
DATAFORM You don't feel so good getting out of bed. You feel like you're sick.
ENDDATA